        "thesis": "operating-leverage-plus-flow-regime",
        "core_hypothesis": "The non-obvious edge is not simply higher copper prices; it is the combination of strong sales growth, volume-led expansion, copper-price sensitivity, and leadership in a broad market risk-on regime. A pullback after a leader day can be accumulation rather than weakness, but only if price/volume and real-money flow confirm it.",
